DICT PROD.                                                                      
AUTHORITY 'BACKUP'.                                                             
STATUS 'PROD'.                                                                  
KEEP LIST SYSTEMS WHEN END -3 TO END = '-SYS'.                                  
DROP LIST MEMBER WXXX-SYS.                                                      
MAIL ONTO MAILDD.                                                               
MAIL GLOSSARY SIGNIFICANT KEPT-DATA                                             
   GIVING ADMINISTRATIVE-DATA, ALIAS, CATALOG, SEE, COMMENT.                    
